[{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:18.940Z","kind":"reset"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:22.662Z","kind":"json","tag":"say-hospital"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:22.690Z","kind":"speak","voice":"marin","text":"أهلاً وسهلاً دكتور. اليوم عنا حالتين للتدريب. بالغرفة الأولى في مريض بحاجة لفحص سريري، وبالغرفة الثانية عنا تدريب على محاكاة استبدال مفصل الركبة. وين بتحب نبلش؟","audioSec":7},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:30.478Z","kind":"queued","heard":"Hello doctor, nice to meet you."},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:32.113Z","kind":"understand","audioSec":1.42,"audioRms":0.001,"heard":"Hello doctor, nice to meet you.","lang":"english"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:32.124Z","kind":"speak","voice":"marin","text":"Okay. What would you like to do next?","audioSec":2.04},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:37.640Z","kind":"queued","heard":"Take me to room one, please."},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:39.259Z","kind":"understand","audioSec":1.44,"audioRms":0.0015,"heard":"Take me to room one, please.","lang":"english"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:39.266Z","kind":"speak","voice":"marin","text":"Okay. What would you like to do next?","audioSec":2.04},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:39.298Z","kind":"json","tag":"say-hospital"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:39.303Z","kind":"speak","voice":"marin","text":"Sure, follow me to Room 01.","audioSec":1.49},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:48.935Z","kind":"json","tag":"say-welcome"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:48.964Z","kind":"speak","voice":"marin","text":"Welcome. I am Dr. Sara Hassan, and I will be supervising you today. Mr. Reyes, fifty-eight, has come in with chest pain. Assess him as you would a real patient, and tell me what you think.","audioSec":7},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:56.718Z","kind":"queued","heard":"مرحبا سيد رييس، وين بيوجعك بالزبط؟"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:58.739Z","kind":"understand","audioSec":1.86,"audioRms":0.0011,"heard":"مرحبا سيد رييس، وين بيوجعك بالزبط؟","lang":"arabic"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:18:58.747Z","kind":"speak","voice":"cedar","text":"والله مش متأكد منها هاي، آسف.","audioSec":1.59},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:01.103Z","kind":"queued","heard":"خديني على غرفة العمليات"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:02.722Z","kind":"understand","audioSec":1.88,"audioRms":0.0012,"heard":"خديني على غرفة العمليات","lang":"arabic"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:02.726Z","kind":"speak","voice":"marin","text":"تمام. شو حابب تعمل هلّق؟","audioSec":1.32},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:02.746Z","kind":"json","tag":"say-hospital"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:02.752Z","kind":"speak","voice":"marin","text":"تمام، تعال معي على غرفة العمليات.","audioSec":1.81},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:11.266Z","kind":"json","tag":"say-hospital"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:11.272Z","kind":"speak","voice":"marin","text":"وصلنا. الباب بيفتح لحاله، تفضّل.","audioSec":1.76},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:12.073Z","kind":"json","tag":"surgery-say"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:12.085Z","kind":"speak","voice":"marin","text":"أهلاً فيك بغرفة العمليات. خلينا نبلّش بتأكيد مكان العملية.","audioSec":3.19},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:16.109Z","kind":"queued","heard":"شو الخطوة الجاي؟"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:17.750Z","kind":"understand","audioSec":1.62,"audioRms":0.0011,"heard":"شو الخطوة الجاي؟","lang":"arabic"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:17.782Z","kind":"json","tag":"surgery-say"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:17.805Z","kind":"speak","voice":"marin","text":"تأكيد مكان العملية. قبل أي شق، الفريق بيتأكد من المريض ونوع العملية والجهة. هون بتأكد على الركبة اليمنى المعلّمة باستخدام قلم التعليم.","audioSec":7},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:25.583Z","kind":"queued","heard":"Sami, pass me the skin marker please."},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:27.436Z","kind":"understand","audioSec":1.85,"audioRms":0.001,"heard":"Sami, pass me the skin marker please.","lang":"english"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:27.473Z","kind":"speak","voice":"cedar","text":"تفضّل، هاي الأداة: قلم تعليم الجلد.","audioSec":1.93},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:44.857Z","kind":"queued","heard":"Take me back to the corridor."},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:46.503Z","kind":"understand","audioSec":1.63,"audioRms":0.0011,"heard":"Take me back to the corridor.","lang":"english"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:46.527Z","kind":"speak","voice":"marin","text":"Before any incision the team confirms the patient, the procedure and the side. Here you confirm the marked RIGHT knee with the skin marker.","audioSec":7},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:46.558Z","kind":"speak","voice":"marin","text":"تمام، خلينا نطلع عالممر.","audioSec":1.32},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:48.651Z","kind":"speak","voice":"marin","text":"أنا مستنيتك هون، خذ وقتك.","audioSec":1.38},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:50.952Z","kind":"speak","voice":"marin","text":"يلا نكمل.","audioSec":0.9},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:54.604Z","kind":"json","tag":"say-hospital"},{"t":"2026-11-28T03:19:54.619Z","kind":"speak","voice":"marin","text":"فيك تختار. احكيلي الغرفة الأولى أو غرفة العمليات، أو اختار من اللوحة، وأنا بمشي معك.","audioSec":4.62}]